      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "These three images were from event viewer, starting with a low memory condition at 8:28:34, then my screen went dark likely at the Desktop Window Manager process ending at 8:29:44 when audio cut out as well, before my audio came back right before or maybe delayed after VRChat crashed at 8:29:47. Discord had also crashed at this time, but event viewer never flagged it. I am curious if VRChat crashing may link to it, given the output log talking about connecting to Discord when you load up the game.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
