      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I was informed on Discord that this is an issue that originates in Unity and that VRChat cannot solve it at the root level. I want to put a comment though with what I had said, that being that I think it would be good to test workarounds to try to mitigate this issue without requiring full reloading into an instance.\nTwo ideas in particular(thanks Zuvali) are below:\n1. For instances to be separated into different scenes, which can have loading triggers to unload active memory and free up space.\n2. For a manual and/or automatic process of reloading the scene without exiting the instance, perhaps by making each instance have parallel interactable scenes if such is possible, or through whatever other possible means.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
