      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yea welcome to vrchat where the dlc includes needing 32GB of ram and at least 16GB of vram to not have to worry about running out of memory while playing.\nYes there are ways they could probably get it solved. I would love to know if the vrchat team are contacting unity to find out if their assetbundle system can be updated to actually clear unused memory, or if they are investigating getting the source code to fix this at all.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
